
flowchart TD
  A[Start: pytron package CLI] --> B[Create BuildContext]
  B --> C{Prepare modules}
  C --> C1[AssetCollector]
  C --> C2[ModuleScanner]
  C --> C3[NativeCollector]
  C --> C4[PluginHookCollector]
  C1 --> D[Populate add_data, hidden_imports, pathex]
  C2 --> D
  C3 --> D
  C4 --> D
  D --> E{Build wrappers chain}
  E --> F[Wrapper: secure_loader (optional)]
  E --> G[Wrapper: strip/debug/strip symbols]
  E --> H[Core build executor]
  H --> H1[PyInstaller or Nuitka]
  H1 --> I[Produce dist / single-binary]
  I --> J{Post-build modules}
  J --> K[Patch binary (embed resources)]
  J --> L[Sign installers]
  J --> M[Create installers (NSIS/DMG/deb)]
  M --> Z[Artifacts: installers, dist, patches]
  K --> Z
  L --> Z
  Z --> END[Done]
